The '''NASDAQ 100''' is a [[stock market index]] of 100 of the largest domestic and international non-financial companies listed on the [[NASDAQ]] stock exchange based on [[market capitalization]].  It does not contain financial companies, including investment companies.

Note: The NASDAQ 100 is a [[weighted average]]; that is, some companies affect the index value more than others.

